   "text": "Wall Street's speed traders go all in on AI. Jane Street, HRT and rivals now spend 10 to 20 times more on AI compute than before ChatGPT. They're building data centres in Norway and Finland and backing chipmakers like Etched.\n\nRead the full article: https://lnkd.in/eSFEMd8F",
