  "7520560266619592704": {
   "created": 1793041292,
   "author": "Anton Golub",
   "url": "https://www.linkedin.com/posts/antongolub_jane-street-hudson-river-trading-xtx-markets-activity-7520560266619592704-WlIw",
   "text": "Jane Street, Hudson River Trading, XTX Markets & Citadel are investing $20bil in AI computing infrastructure\n\nJane Street signed $19 billion in multiyear AI cloud agreements with CoreWeave and Crusoe. Firm generated $39.6 billion in net trading revenue in 2025, so we're talking about AI investments are half of its annual trading revenue. It also led a $700 million investment round in Etched, an AI chipmaker valued at $21 billion, and has already installed Etched hardware in its own data center. \n\nXTX Markets operates more than 25,000 GPUs and over 1 exabyte of data storage. Firm trades $250 billion daily across global markets with just 300 employees. Its machine-learning models generate pric",
